# A CRLF shebang line ("#!/bin/sh\r\n") fails inside a Linux container with "bad
# interpreter" -- this repo's core.autocrlf=true (confirmed on this dev machine) would
# otherwise check shell scripts out with CRLF, which Docker COPY then bakes into the image
# verbatim if the image is ever built from a Windows working tree.
*.sh text eol=lf
